{
  "_comment": [
    "OPT-IN registration for the terraform-apply security gate. This file is",
    "NOT loaded by Claude Code -- it is named hooks.json.example on purpose so",
    "that installing the plugin arms NOTHING. See hooks/README.md to enable.",
    "",
    "Two independent gates must both be turned on before the hook ever blocks:",
    "  (1) register it (this snippet), and",
    "  (2) create .claude/iac-security-scan.local.md with `apply_gate: block`",
    "      (or warn/ask). Without the flag file the hook no-ops instantly.",
    "",
    "The gate FAILS OPEN: if the scan errors or times out, the apply proceeds."
  ],
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/apply_gate.py",
            "timeout": 150
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
